; Draw one 8x8 tile bitmap into C consecutive screen cells
;
; Copies the same 8 bytes to the C cells that follow DE on one screen row (INC E per cell; the cells must not cross a 32-cell boundary). Used for the status bar (#R$9BF3, #R$9C1B).
; .
; Hardware: writes the screen bitmap.
;
; C Number of cells
; DE Screen address of pixel row 0 of the first cell
; HL Address of the 8 bitmap bytes (not advanced)
; O:C 0
@label=DrawTileCells
c$9C3B PUSH HL       ;
 $9C3C PUSH DE       ;
 $9C3D CALL $9BCA    ; copy 8 bytes HL -> DE, DE steps down the 8 pixel rows
 $9C40 POP DE        ;
 $9C41 POP HL        ;
 $9C42 INC E         ; next cell on the row
 $9C43 DEC C         ;
 $9C44 JR NZ,$9C3B   ;
 $9C46 RET           ;
